<title>DENMARK: Danish premier leaves hospital after gym collapse.</title>
<headline>Danish premier leaves hospital after gym collapse.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish Prime Minister Poul Nyrup Rasmussen left hospital on Thursday evening after a 24-hour stay following his collapse at a Copenhagen fitness centre, his office said.</p>
<p>He was expected to return to work on Monday.</p>
<p>An aide earlier said that Rasmussen became dehydrated and passed out on Wednesday after exercising without drinking enough water.</p>
</text>
